> It Takes Teams to Tango[ (TM]) is a totally unique and innovative facilitation tool for developing COMMUNICATION and COLLABORATION in organisations.
Based[ on] principles of connecting with others in the Argentine tango, the tool is a fun team learning experience[ which] is[ applicable] to everybody who wants to work more product[ively] with others.
Developed by[ R]achael Glaser, It Takes Teams to tango has[ strong foundations in] her training and work as a[ communications therapist],[ policy consultant,] and[ corporate communications] facilit[ator]. Based on the client's[ requirements] Libertango collaborates with talented professional dancers and executive coaches to give maximum[ value] to the event.
The tool is adaptable to any setting and is effective[ as] a workshop, conference presentation or for corporate getaway learning.[][]

