The significance of unity will take the center stage in these festivals.
Dubbed as Experience Marikina, the local government has lined up numerous activities to celebrate its three major festivals in the last two months of the year: the Sapatos Festival, the Rehiyon, Re[hi]yon, and the Christmas Festival[.]
The city will also commemorate the 22nd year since it became a chartered city on December[ 8], 1996.
