> Wild garlic pesto shrimp pasta is a fresh and easy pasta dish made with saute[ed] shrimps, mar[inated in] flavour[ful] wild garlic pesto… Perfect for lunch or dinner!
Lately, I’ve been all about easy and quick lunch and dinner ideas, and this recipe is one of my all-time favourite recipes. This whole[ thing] is ready in just[ 20] minutes, perfect for busy days or even date nights!
Wild garlic[ can] be found normally from March to June, and since it’s the season of wild garlic I wanted to share this recipe with you. However, if you can’t find wild garlic then you can go for regular basil pesto and the result will also be very delicious!
Wild garlic pesto is very easy to make. You will need wild garlic, gr[ated] parmesan cheese, pine nuts[,] olive oil[,] lemon juice[ and] salt[ &] pepper[.] Simply[ place] all ingredients in a food processor and[ blitz] until you get the desired consistency. You can add more olive oil to the mixture if needed.
This luxury shrimp pasta dish is very easy and quick to make[.] It is ready in just 20 minutes, and you can’t beat that! All you need to do is[ cook] the pasta, marinate[ (]or[ coat] if you don’t have time) the shrimp in pesto, sa[ute] the[ shrimp], make a simple creamy sauce for the pasta,[ toss everything] together, top the pasta with shrimps, and finish with a sprinkle of grated parmesan cheese and freshly chopped parsley!
This creamy wild garlic pesto shrimp pasta is packed[ with] flavour[.] Perfect for lunch or dinner and can be ready in under[ 20] minutes!
Place all ingredients in a food processor and blitz until you reach the desired consistency. You can add more olive oil if needed.
Mar[inate] shrimp in wild garlic pesto for[ 15]-[20 minutes.] Or just[ coat] in pest[o] if you don't have much time[.]
Cook[ pasta] according to instructions on the pack. I add a little bit of olive oil and a pinch of salt[ to boiling] water before adding pasta.
[While pasta is] cooking, cook the shrim[ps.] Heat olive oil in a pan, then add shrimps[ and cook until] shrimps[ are pink and] round.
